# Copy this file to ".env" in the project root (the folder with
# package.json) and fill in the keys you have. ".env" is gitignored —
# never commit it, and never paste a key into chat or an issue.
#
# The app has TWO separate keys, one per service:
#
# 1. The app's core — Meta Model API (notes -> cue plan / analysis).
#    MODEL_API_KEY is Meta's own name for this key.
MODEL_API_KEY=

# 2. Voice only — Grok (xAI) TTS, for pre-generating cue audio.
#    A Meta key cannot call xAI and an xAI key cannot call Meta;
#    audio generation needs this second key.
XAI_API_KEY=

# Backwards-compatible alias: META_MODEL_API_KEY is also accepted for
# the Meta key (an earlier scaffold version used that name), but
# MODEL_API_KEY above is the name to use.
#
# `npm test` needs neither key — the tests use local providers/mocks.
